<http://example.org/sen0414-ch15ch16-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 15 and 16"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.5.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch15ch16-lineage/1.5.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch15ch16_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.5.0 (2026-11-11): Close the approval gate and both render stories. Governance re-verification ceremony run first (git fetch + diff against oe-method/04-documentation and backlog-roadmap-framework/04-documentation: clean)."@en .

ex:ST6_ApprovalGate backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Owner approved both drafts as written, no corrections requested, 2026-11-11." .

ex:ST6_RenderCh15 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Render-check re-confirmed from live files: the delivered deck (SEN0414_Ch15_GoogleSheets_3e_v2_0_0.pptx, re-extracted via slide_text.py) and the delivered page (sen0414_ch15_page_v9_96_1.html, grepped for distinguishing story terms Rochelle, Nakamoto, Messina, 'migration guide', Google Forms - all present) already carry the approved draft's 5 stories, explanations, slide outline and resources slide verbatim. No content delta found; no new deck/page version declared." .
ex:ST6_RenderCh16 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Render-check re-confirmed from live files: the delivered deck (SEN0414_Ch16_SQLiteDatabases_3e_v2_0_1.pptx, re-extracted via slide_text.py) and the delivered page (sen0414_ch16_page_v9_97_0.html, grepped for distinguishing story terms Hipp, Codd, pysqlite, Munroe, Haerder - all present) already carry the approved draft's 6 stories, explanations, slide outline and resources slide verbatim. No content delta found; no new deck/page version declared." .
